    # F7: marquee concat-loop win — BexStr makes `s = s + "x"` O(1) per
    # iteration (Concat node) instead of O(n) (clone+push_str). Total goes
    # from O(n²) → O(n). 10k iterations would be ~100M ops vs 10k ops.
    # Python is O(n²) (str is immutable, naïve concat); JS may optimize via
    # ropes internally so its numbers are not directly comparable.
    "concat loop 10k": {
